vernment honor, the Order of the British Empire.","1954 Died by suicide."],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-069.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-070.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":57,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","The Turing Test (1950s)","Separate humans from machines.","Humans ask questions via electronic communication devices.","After multiple rounds of Q&A, if over 30% of people can't distinguish whether the respondent is human or machine, the machine passes the test and is considered to possess human-level intelligence."],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-071.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":58,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","A和B哪个更像人类的回答？为什么？","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的，我不是已经说过了吗？","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：你烦不烦，干嘛老是提同样的问题。","A","B","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-072.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":59,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","A和B哪个更像人类的回答？为什么？","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的，我不是已经说过了吗？","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：你烦不烦，干嘛老是提同样的问题。","A","B","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","问：你会下国际象棋吗？","答：是的。","遵照特定规则回答","机械式回答","具有综合分析和理解的能力","能探知提问者在反复提出相同的问题"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-072.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":60,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","表达多样化","内容死板","当今的大模型是否具备人类智能呢？","是的，我可以帮助你了解国际象棋的规则、策略和技巧。如果你有任何具体的问题或者想讨论某个棋局，随时告诉我!","是的，我可以帮助你理解国际象棋的规则、策略和战术。如果你想讨论某个棋局、学习开局或了解特定的战术，请告诉我!"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-073.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-074.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":61,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","一个有趣的实验","弱人工智能","强人工智能","通用智能","认知 & 理解","学习 & 推理"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-075.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":62,"text":["Artificial Intelligence","人工智能的主要流派","深度学习","神经机器翻译","机器阅读理解","预训练LLM","符号主义","符号表达，数理逻辑推理","规则系统、专家系统","联结主义","模拟人脑神经元的连接方式","Yann LeCun：LeNet","Geoffrey Hinton：BP、DBN","Yoshua Bengio：GAN","深度学习之父","2018年图灵奖","兴起","图灵测试","熵&信息论","马尔可夫过程","香农、图灵","乔姆斯基生成文法","感知机、特征工程","知识图谱"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-076.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":63,"text":["基础知识 | 三种常见视觉语言大模型架构","CLIP-Based VLMs","LMM-based VLMs","Diffusion-based VLMs"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-077.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":64,"text":["基础知识 | CLIP-based VLM 代表性工作","利用在地面上拍摄的互联网图像文本对以及对应的遥感图片构建地面-卫星图像对数据集。从 Flickr 网站采集了带地理位置的图片，精确到街道级别，过滤掉室内场景的。然后再使用 Google Earth Engine 下载 NAIP （2年重访）和 Sentinel-2（5天重访） 光学遥感图像。","数据集","网络结构","测试基准","硬件条件","Scene classification, Visual question answering，Segmentation，Retrieval","未知，分辨率 224*224","CLIP-ViT(B-32,B-16)","训练策略","使用 CLIP 范式训练","比较对象","CLIP，CLIP-RSICD，RemoteCLIP","GRAFT（2023-12-12 康奈尔大学 ICLR2024）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":65,"text":["基础知识 | Diffusion-based VLM 代表性工作","DiffusionSat（2023-12-06 斯坦佛大学 ICLR2024）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-078.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":66,"text":["基础知识 | LLM-based VLM 代表性工作","RS Multimodal Instruction Dataset：30k图片细节描述，65k多轮对话，10k复杂问答，2个 RSVQA 数据集，1个 RSSC 数据集，45k Grounding Description，40k Region Captioning，25k Referring Expression","数据集","网络结构","测试基准","硬件条件","Visual Question Answering，Scene Classification，Referring Expression，Region Caption","4 块 A100（40G），分辨率 504*504","CLIP-ViT(L-14) (视觉编码器) + Vicuna7b (大语言模型) + MLP adaptor（2 个线性层）","训练策略","使用 LoRA 微调大语言模型，固定 MLP 和视觉编码器权重","比较对象","Qwen-VL，LLaVA-1.5，MiniGPT4-v2","GeoChat（2023-11-24 阿联酋人工智能大学 CVPR2024）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":67,"text":["基础知识 | 支持的任务"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-079.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-080.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":68,"text":["Geo-Localization"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-081.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-082.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-083.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-083-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":69,"text":["空间智能研究视频"],"figures":[],"links":[],"embed":{"provider":"bilibili","bvid":"BV1a6Z9YtESY","title":"空间智能研究视频","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a6Z9YtESY/"}},{"page":70,"text":["当商业航天遇上大模型","2026年《政府工作报告》首次将航空航天列为新兴支柱产业，国家“十五五”规划纲要进一步明确了航天强国战略方向，并将商业航天纳入战略性新兴产业发展清单。","上海市“十五五”规划纲要强调，积极推进低空经济、商业航天、卫星互联网等新兴领域规模化、集群化发展，助力上海市科技创新中心建设。中国科协亦将“卫星遥感数据的智能化处理与产业化应用”列为十大产业技术问题之一。","SpaceX最終上市估值約為2.1兆美元","Anthropic 估值逼近万亿美元"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-084.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-085.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":71,"text":["基础知识 | 任务分类"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-086.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":72,"text":["发展脉络 | Caption 数据集的演变","Cap.","Region Cap."],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-087.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":73,"text":["发展脉络 | Caption 数据集的演变","Grounded Cap. & Detailed Cap.","Temporal Cap."],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-088.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-089.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":74,"text":["发展脉络 | VQA 数据集的演变","VQA & Region VQA"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-090.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":75,"text":["发展脉络 | VQA 数据集的演变","Temporal VQA","Grounded VQA"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-091.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-092.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":76,"text":["发展脉络 | Visual Grounding 数据集的演变","REC","Generalized REC"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-093.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-094.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":77,"text":["发展脉络 | Visual Grounding 数据集的演变","RES","T-GREC"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-095.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-096.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":78,"text":["发展脉络 | Visual Grounding 数据集的演变","T-GRES","Generalized RES"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-097.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-098.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":79,"text":["基础知识 | 任务分类"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-086.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":80,"text":["数据集分析 | 增长势头正旺"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":81,"text":["顶会投稿数量 | 同样增长势头正旺"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-099.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-100.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-101.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":82,"text":["研究热点 | 大模型 or 小模型？"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-102.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":83,"text":["研究热点 | 大模型让科研人员更“大胆”了"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-103.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":84,"text":["前沿研究 | 空间感知","AirSpatialBot: A Spatially Aware Aerial Agent for Fine-Grained Vehicle Attribute Recognition and Retrieval.","IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing, 2025 （中科院一区 Top）","基于视觉语言大模型的无人机空间感知智能体","现有遥感智能解译是在二维平面上对目标进行检测识别和定位（包括目标的颜色、相对大小等直观属性），但是无法满足在实际应用场景中对空间感知的需求。","实际问题","针对现有解译技术在空间理解上的局限，提出空间感知智能体 AirSpatialBot，首次实现了遥感领域的空间智能，自主构建首个无人机3D定位数据集。","贡献点"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-104.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":85,"text":["前沿研究 | 空间感知","AirSpatialBot: A Spatially Aware Aerial Agent for Fine-Grained Vehicle Attribute Recognition and Retrieval.","IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing, 2025（中科院一区 Top）","基于空间感知大模型实现零样本车辆型号识别"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-105.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-106.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-106-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":86,"text":["前沿研究 | 视觉推理","DVGBench: Implicit-to-Explicit Visual Grounding Benchmark in UAV Imagery with Large Vision-Language Models.","ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 2026（中科院一区 Top）","视觉推理定位任务"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-107.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":87,"text":["前沿研究 | 视觉推理","交通管理、灾害救援、公共安全、","体育赛事、社交活动、生产活动。","六大隐式推理场景"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-108.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-108-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-109.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-109-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-110.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-110-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-111.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-111-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-112.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":88,"text":["前沿研究 | 视觉推理","DVGBench: Implicit-to-Explicit Visual Grounding Benchmark in UAV Imagery with Large Vision-Language Models.","ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 2026（中科院一区 Top）","基于隐转显思维链显著提高隐式视觉定位精度"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-113.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-114.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":89,"text":["数据集制作指南 | 三种数据集构造方式","一、完全人工构造：全程依赖人类专家的构造方式","特点：无算法参与，数据的生成、验证（交叉）、优化均由人工完成。","适合构建：高精度、小样本、需要专业知识的场景，如：Benchmark","优点：数据多样，质量高","缺点：效率低，需要高质量人力（不推荐用于 Cap. 任务）","优秀案例：XLRS-Bench（CVPR2025 Oral）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":90,"text":["数据集制作指南 | 三种数据集构造方式","二、完全自动构造：无人工干预的算法生成方式","特点：以已有数据集为基础，通过规则自动生成模板数据，无需人工参与。","适合构建：大规模、重复性的场景","缺点：缺乏数据多样性（可通过大模型润色来提升多样性）","优点：只要规则和算法正确，则生成的数据无需人工检验","优秀案例：GeoChat（CVPR 2024）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":91,"text":["数据集制作指南 | 三种数据集构造方式","三、半自动构造：人工与算法协同的高效构造方式​","特点：通过模型完成生成，人工完成验证/优化，兼顾效率与质量，是工业界最常用的数据构造方式","优点：数据多样、速度快","缺点：需要人工验证（全量、抽样）","优秀案例：VRSBench（NeurIPS 2024）"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-002.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":92,"text":["迈向真实的物理世界","Sec. 3"],"figures":[],"links":[]},{"page":93,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机自主飞行","带本科生开展无人机自主飞行实验","Shuliang Guo, Jiaming Chen, Yue Zhou"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-115.webp","animated":false},{"src":"assets/figure-116.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-116-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-117.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-117-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-118.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-118-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":94,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机自主飞行","带本科生开展无人机自主飞行实验","Shuliang Guo, Jiaming Chen, Yue Zhou"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-119.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-119-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-120.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-120-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-121.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-121-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-122.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-122-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":95,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机主动感知","FlyCo: Foundation Model-Empowered Drones for Autonomous 3D Structure Scanning in Open-World Environments","Chen Feng*, Guiyong Zheng*, Tengkai Zhuang, Yongqian Wu, Fangzhan He, Haojia Li, Juepeng Zheng, Shaojie Shen, Boyu Zhou"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-123.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-123-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-124.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-124-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-125.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-125-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":96,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机主动感知","带本科生开展无人机海上主动感知实验   Jiaming Chen, Yue Zhou"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-126.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-126-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-127.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-127-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-128.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-128-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":97,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机听指令行动","UAV Claw  Xiangyu Wang, Donglin Yang, Wenhao Zheng, Zimu Tang, Zhibo Zhang, Yantong Zhong, Xiangyi Zheng, Qinan Liao, Si Liu"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-129.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-129-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-130.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-130-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-131.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-131-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-132.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-132-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":98,"text":["前沿研究 | 无人机抓取物体","Hand-like autonomous flying robot for airborne grasping and interaction  Yuze Wu, Fan Yang, Rui Jin, Yuhang Zhong, Junjie Wang, Xuankang Wu & Fei Gao"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-133.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-133-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-134.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-134-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-135.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-135-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true},{"src":"assets/figure-136.mp4","poster":"assets/figure-136-poster.webp","animated":true,"video":true}],"links":[]},{"page":99,"text":["前沿研究 | JEPA","SkyJEPA: Learning Long-Horizon World Models for Zero-Shot Sim-to-Real Control of Quadrotors Pratyaksh Rao, Wancong Zhang, Randall Balestriero, Yann LeCun, Giuseppe Loianno"],"figures":[{"src":"assets/figure-137.webp","animated":false}],"links":[]},{"page":100,"text":["前沿研究 | JEPA","SkyJEPA: Learning Long-Horizon World Models for Z